{"title":"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of all positive two-digit integers that are divisible by each of their digits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let our number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/9556236ef13d6694209b35b0fc1f4a459e7c353d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4fde2e855d4ba3c6d6ee7a4dead335bb4f13c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />. Then we have two conditions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f9050f1e497180055f6abd16fe046ead541ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a + b \\equiv 10a \\equiv 0 \\pmod{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d73d05d455055dfc2dd90e0d7edf71358829ded3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a + b \\equiv b \\pmod{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> divides into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> divides into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b38666b2fe62287cf8268eceddbbc8aa47ccff05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aaee41a8a5693ce64d5d4c6d6ab2d09271fc152.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a, 2a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f1cd011e4f743ca6187ecad0222dce00a68993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> (note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f700df92ca2fe15e6010c409b84ceedbf37787bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 10a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> would not be a digit).  \n</p>\n<ul><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2510c0ee8fa65393d9a6689e806595cd57234ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa2218df1ad8d0b93a8449ffb782fd77ee326b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 11a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> for nine possibilities, giving us a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83575b3f9eb38f30f448e8043a2454d8b315477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 \\cdot \\frac {9(10)}{2} = 495$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"127\" height=\"38\" />.</li>\n<li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8001670b48cdd67d910642bc830258fc70e863.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2a$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851838b4817fcefa35fea087f34283d0f653a3a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 12a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> for four possibilities (the higher ones give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf43a861481b953fb42a09b48df7ea101bb0bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />), giving us a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/03831de7b6ff099ea5bd9c88b0652bc7a6b2bbfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\cdot \\frac {4(5)}{2} = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" />.</li>\n<li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd0ad6fe427beef4d0a310bf949ca3c9d671ff1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5a$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1af60f670fb9eae43be3b725a36b3bcc848978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 15a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> for one possibility (again, higher ones give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf43a861481b953fb42a09b48df7ea101bb0bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />), giving us a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>If we ignore the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7a58270d4285821716c6093a83541f3ea31dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> as we have been doing so far, then the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4a736517f8d82715f587506ee0d01f51bbb3b78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$495 + 120 + 15 = \\boxed{630}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By testing every 2-digit number, we can list out all of the possibilities: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddc68df2b734514c416f9a91b9bb57b991b8c9de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[11+12+15+22+24+33+36+44+48+55+66+77+88+99=\\boxed{630}.\\]\" width=\"503\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To further expand on solution 2, it would be tedious to test all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> two-digit numbers. We can reduce the amount to look at by focusing on the tens digit.\nFirst, we cannot have any number that is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We also note that any number with the same digits is a number that satisfies this problem. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c13f4d21f276d81252757727a49f65f39c2ae390.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[11, 22, 33, ... 99.\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" /> We start from each of these numbers and constantly add the digit of the tens number of the respective number until we get a different tens digit. For example, we look at numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad4e794030e2c9dc0a10c3f4ba959a0fb7462c51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11, 12, 13, ... 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"17\" /> and numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20bb6bd048db171ea8d5e986ed98bf1389550f33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22, 24, 26, 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />. This heavily reduces the numbers we need to check, as we can deduce that any number with a tens digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or greater that does not have two of the same digits is not a valid number for this problem. This will give us the numbers from solution 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In this solution, we will do casework on the ones digit.\nBefore we start, let's make some variables. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the ones digit, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the tens digit. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equal our number. Our number can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/91637b4521e1c07f0aa214e1070b7c2f81c10967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />. We can easily see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4e9fbed29a451c0ad472c706ef7712baee0a934.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b5cf7c5a44ccf548d7f916df87872a13f3ca14b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/2/56257a33a716075f5d1de29021653a27c786328d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|10b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aa0497bb475eeee94e30ca53980aeb9c005ff9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|(n-10b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />. \nNow, let's start with the casework.\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4e9fbed29a451c0ad472c706ef7712baee0a934.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. From this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093e72c1ebd91ade8c33ce3bcc3ccd3e640cad8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> satisfies the condition.\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />\nWe either have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. From this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be185b7073ad0f180c628cc203f28e9bd941df65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d535c87e35958984ff5b6ac1ba12b874e670d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=22$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> satisfy the condition.\n</p><p>Case 3: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />\nWe have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. From this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af03e63867997cd8e736d40d72778669cef9bd84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> satisfies the condition. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> was not included because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> does not divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Case 4: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ffa3b8792f0170bce1ab6008e907343100d70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />\nWe either have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. From this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ece448a1996d075309961bd398a7c8afc99a50e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/902e32c280b1b6385d74d2a8bb6f0d7206dc5195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> satisfy the condition. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> was not included for similar reasons as last time.\n</p><p>Case 5: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />\nWe either have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f69c1ec597d19324140f3130e9d63367f4b69c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. From this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cee94ee92654e843d9cf2f18541e37eab00b47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c2f923c062b7b69dd1b2d44c18e2745137c7102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=55$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> satisfy the condition.\n</p><p>Continuing with this process up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/792fa2135a12f746ee8d35f224cc514437dd03c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=9$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> could be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63568d472ff6e0e9941be8cdeb9f077b8e77358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11, 12, 22, 33, 24, 44, 15, 55, 36, 66, 77, 48, 88, 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"359\" height=\"16\" />. Summing, we get that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d54de1e257c31025c255b9c575c36e563405310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{630}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />. A clever way to sum would be to group the multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> together to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/3/163e5a102c39980c4c2e99bcaa43319b778fde05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11+22+\\dots+99=(45)(11)=495$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"282\" height=\"18\" />, and then add the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b4089a20a74ec39dd997b6327bf5e356e653176.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12+24+15+36+48=135$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"230\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><i>-bronzetruck2016</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I\" title=\"2001 AIME I\">2001 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" tit